WEBVTT

00:07:59.376 --> 00:08:00.526
JG: Number two,

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:04.212
we know that women leaders
face sexism and stereotyping,

00:08:04.236 --> 00:08:06.323
so sit down with your mentors,

00:08:06.347 --> 00:08:08.492
sponsors, best supporters and friends

00:08:08.516 --> 00:08:10.042
and war-game.

00:08:10.066 --> 00:08:12.564
How are you going to deal
with the gendered moments,

00:08:12.588 --> 00:08:14.350
with being judged on your appearance,

00:08:14.374 --> 00:08:16.350
with being assumed to be a bit of a bitch

00:08:16.374 --> 00:08:18.925
or with your family choices questioned?

00:08:18.949 --> 00:08:21.218
Forewarned is forearmed.

00:08:21.787 --> 00:08:23.020
NOI: Number three,

00:08:23.044 --> 00:08:26.231
let everyone you know
talking about gender stereotypes

00:08:26.255 --> 00:08:27.700
and debunking them:

00:08:27.724 --> 00:08:31.832
these false assumptions can't survive
being held up to the light of day.